   "xp": 100
  },
  {
   "copper": 25,
   "description": "Zombies approach Dawnmere's lantern road after nightfall. Defeat three beyond the houses in the level-3-and-up fields. The daytime repair work and optional tool lessons remain alternatives while the road is quiet.",
